### Step 1 — Public route: no guard, always allowed
GET http://localhost:3000/guards/public

### Step 2 — Private route without an API key: returns 401
GET http://localhost:3000/guards/private

### Step 2 — Private route with a valid API key: allowed
GET http://localhost:3000/guards/private
x-api-key: secret-123

### Step 3 — Admin route without an API key: blocked by ApiKeyGuard (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/guards/admin

### Step 3 — Admin route with API key but wrong role: blocked by RolesGuard (403)
GET http://localhost:3000/guards/admin
x-api-key: secret-123
x-user-role: customer

### Step 3 — Admin route with API key and admin role: allowed
GET http://localhost:3000/guards/admin
x-api-key: secret-123
x-user-role: admin
